  "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
  "name": "Qatar",
  "notes": [
   "The law gives Pantone 1955 C and white. The hex and CMYK values are Wikipedia's for that Pantone, as FOTW reports them. The Album des Pavillons 2023 gives a different color, Pantone 222 C, so it isn't used here.",
   "Annex 1 says 11:28 is for use inside Qatar, and that abroad a flag follows the host country's proportions by Figures 5 to 8. Those are the variants here.",
   "Figure 8 labels its triangle length 16% of 2/3 L, but its whole table works out to 18%, and the variant follows the table."
  ],
  "render-license": "CC0-1.0",
  "restrictions": [
   {
    "sources": [
     "https://web.archive.org/web/20220817071605/https://www.customs.gov.qa/English/Legislations/Documents/Executive%20Resolutions/Prevent%20clearance%20of%20goods%20contrary%20to%20the%20provisions%20of%20the%20law%20No.%20%284%29%20of%202012%20about%20Qatari%20flag.pdf"
    ],
    "text": "Article 5: the flag may not be used for purposes contrary to its original purpose, have words, pictures or designs added, or be used commercially, as a brand or part of one, or for advertising."
